&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;GENCİMİZ G&amp;Uuml;NDE SADECE BİR KAHVE İ&amp;Ccedil;SE BİLE ALDIĞI BURS YETMİYOR&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Emeklimiz, &amp;ccedil;ift&amp;ccedil;imiz, &amp;uuml;reticimiz b&amp;ouml;yle de geleceğimizi emanet ettiğimizin gen&amp;ccedil;lerin durumu farklı mı? İşte &amp;ouml;nceki g&amp;uuml;n KYK bursları a&amp;ccedil;ıklandı; Lisans bursu 3 bin liradan 4 bin liraya &amp;ccedil;ıktı. Yani asgari &amp;uuml;cretin 7&amp;rsquo;de 1&amp;rsquo;i. Bakınız size KYK enflasyonunda nereden nereye geldiğimizi anlatayım. Yıl 2016; Bir &amp;ouml;ğrencimizin KYK bursu 400 lira, Asgari &amp;uuml;cret: Bin 300 lira.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Yani Asgari &amp;uuml;cretin 3&amp;rsquo;te biri&amp;hellip;Şimdi ne olmuş? 7&amp;rsquo;de 1&amp;rsquo;i. Arkadaşlar gencimiz g&amp;uuml;nde sadece bir kahve i&amp;ccedil;se bile aldığı burs yetmiyor. Peki şimdi soruyoruz; Gen&amp;ccedil;lerimiz; Kitap mı alsın? Yemek mi yesin? Yurt parası mı &amp;ouml;desin?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Gen&amp;ccedil;ler zaten sinemayı, tiyatroyu, konseri unutalı &amp;ccedil;ok oldu.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;UYUŞTURUCU KURYESİ, YEMEK KURYESİNDEN HIZLI GELİYORSA ORADA DEVLETİN OTORİTESİ DEĞİL &amp;Ccedil;ETELERİN H&amp;Uuml;KM&amp;Uuml; VARDIR!&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Gencimiz kahveye, Emeklimiz proteine ulaşamıyor ama biz &amp;uuml;lke olarak ne konuşuyoruz;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Birilerinin sa&amp;ccedil;ından, tırnağından fışkıran kokaini konuşuyoruz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar; Ekonominin bozuk, enflasyonun y&amp;uuml;ksek olduğu &amp;uuml;lkelerde ne yazık ki biten sadece ekonomi olmuyor.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Bug&amp;uuml;n gelecekten umudunu kesmiş milyonlarca insanımız kumar, sanal bahis uyuşturucu batağına s&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;kleniyor. Bizler yıllardır uyuşturucu ile m&amp;uuml;cadele i&amp;ccedil;in &amp;ccedil;ağrıda bulunuyoruz. Yeni Yol Grubu olarak Uyuşturucu ile M&amp;uuml;cadele Zirvesi d&amp;uuml;zenledik.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;İktidara dedik ki; ey iktidar, gelin hep birlikte uyuşturucu ve kumarla m&amp;uuml;cadele edelim.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;İktidar bu &amp;ccedil;ağrımıza aylar sonra kulak verdi ama onda da belli ki bizi yanlış anlamış;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; bizim &amp;ccedil;ağrımız uyuşturucu ile m&amp;uuml;cadele ediyormuş gibi g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;p magazin g&amp;uuml;ndemi oluşturmak değildi. Bug&amp;uuml;n sokaklar uyuşturucu dolu. Uyuşturucu kuryesinin, yemek kuryesinden daha hızlı geldiği bir ger&amp;ccedil;ekle karşı karşıyayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bir başka ifadeyle s&amp;ouml;yleyeyim; Uyuşturucu kuryesi, yemek kuryesinden hızlı geliyorsa orada devletin otoritesi değil &amp;ccedil;etelerin h&amp;uuml;km&amp;uuml; vardır! Uyuşturucu tacirleri dışarıda, satıcılar dışarıda,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;aracılar dışarıda, onları koruyanlar dışarıda.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sonra da &amp;ccedil;ıkıp; Ana medyada, sosyal medyada &amp;ldquo;uyuşturucu ile m&amp;uuml;cadele ediyoruz&amp;rdquo; diyeceksiniz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bu vesile ile bir kez daha &amp;ccedil;ağrıda bulunuyoruz; Gelin 2026 yılını samimi olarak &amp;ldquo;Bağımlılıkla M&amp;uuml;cadele Yılı&amp;rdquo; olarak ilan edelim ve meclis başta olmak &amp;uuml;zere her kurumu, her STK&amp;#39;yı kapsayan bir birliktelikle bu illetlerin k&amp;ouml;k&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml; kazıyalım. Aksi takdirde bug&amp;uuml;n gen&amp;ccedil;lerimizi esir eden, aileleri dağıtan, toplumu &amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;ten tehlikenin &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml; alınamaz.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

